## Reviewer disagreements (not applied)

- da-a 8. English discovery notice is «does not promise search ranking, endorsement, recommendation, or guaranteed visibility.» «Visning» and a doubled «anbefaling» do not match. Applied «anprisning» and «garanteret synlighed».
- da-b 25 heading. «Ikke-formueretligt tab (非財產上損害)» is the Danish term for non-pecuniary loss. Only the body «moralsk lidelse» was wrong.
- da-a 39 and the ZWSP sweep. Promoting Q16–Q20 and deleting the padding would fail heading, block and ZWSP parity with Korean. Personal-voice sentences inside those blocks were still rewritten.
- da-a 53. Deleting the difficulty row would drop a table row. The header now says what Enkel/Vanskelig/Enkel measures.
- da-a 30 and da-a 57. Pinned figure and live Hangul urls, per ACCEPTED-ROUND.
- retssubjekt / retssubjektivitet are Danish for legal personality. The subjekt sweep was the 主體 calque only.
- A global replacement of «bilag» would break grundbilag and betalingsbilag, which are exhibits. Only the signature sentence and the evidence calques in the flagged paragraphs were changed.
